& i=\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \sin (100 \pi t) \text { ampere } \\
& e=\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \sin (100 \pi t+\pi / 3) \text { volt }
\end{aligned}

The average power in Watts consumed in the circuit is

